 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Upon a hill outside the gate",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They raised a cross of wood",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And there the Son of God was hung",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Where we ourselves had stood",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 2.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But may I never boast in anything",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Except the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through which the world has been crucified to me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And I to the world",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 4.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The crowd went by and shook their heads",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And mocked him as he died",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.5,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The soldiers gambled for his clothes",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And pierced him in his side",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But may I never boast in anything",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Except the cross of our Lord Jesus Christ",
